cxbom
Owner: ATACE Working Group.

The cxbom code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

This product includes files vendored byte-identically from the ATACE artifact,
commit 3e7f88f (Apache-2.0): cxbom/detectors.py, cxbom/validator.py,
cxbom/crosswalk.py (the last two with one declared data-path line each), the
CxBOM 0.2.0 schema, and the catalogs in cxbom/_data/catalogs/.

cxbom/_data/catalogs/cwe.json records CWE identifiers and names. CWE is
maintained by The MITRE Corporation and is used under the CWE Terms of Use
(https://cwe.mitre.org/about/termsofuse.html). CWE is a trademark of The MITRE
Corporation.

cxbom/_data/catalogs/atlas.json records MITRE ATLAS technique identifiers and
names from https://github.com/mitre-atlas/atlas-data. MITRE ATLAS is a
trademark of The MITRE Corporation.

cxbom/_data/catalogs/owasp-*.json record identifiers and titles from the OWASP
Top 10 for LLM Applications (2025 and 2026) and the OWASP Top 10 for Agentic
Applications 2026, published by the OWASP GenAI Security Project under
CC-BY-SA-4.0. Only factual identifier-to-title reference data is recorded.
Sources and retrieval dates are in cxbom/_data/catalogs/SOURCES.json.

